WEBVTT

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.100
Do you understand?

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.520
You almost got Lieutenant Conrad killed!

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.450
Everything will be all right.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.490
Leave it to us.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:14.990
Lee-san...

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.120
You opened your cockpit during battle

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.740
and even tried to make contact with an enemy pilot.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.400
Just what the hell were you thinking?!

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.870
It was Hina.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:28.090
It doesn't matter <i>who</i> it was!

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.550
Zogilia is the enemy!

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:33.010
Can't you differentiate between
who to fight and who to protect?

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.640
Hina is not the enemy.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.430
She was the one who saved me before.

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.060
You're still spouting that nonsense?

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.970
Don't you think that's enough, Dio?

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:43.310
You're still injured from the forced Decoupling, you know?

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.020
But…

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.150
It's not like you to get all pissed off at an amateur.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:47.900
That's right.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:52.590
Even though he can pilot a Valiancer, this guy is still a civilian.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:56.450
You shouldn't be forcing him to follow military teachings.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.660
I understand.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.640
C'mon now.

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:03.290
Thanks to you, we didn't have to swim.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:08.250
Lee!

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:18.260
Hey, go and see him.

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.610
Aoba-kun.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.300
Lee-san.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:27.730
Hey, I see you're okay.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.770
Yeah.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.400
Um…

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:38.320
If you hadn't been there,
we would've both been killed.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.370
Hey, don't talk so much.

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:45.240
You are our savior.

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:48.830
So don't worry about me. I'm fine.

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:53.090
I thought I told you not to talk. Let's get going now.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.850
This ship will now be heading towards
Narashino Base to repair and resupply.

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:06.190
Maintain the priority patrol deployment. Be wary of the surroundings.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.820
Please wait, Agent Margaret.
Regarding this Secret Service matter...

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:21.620
I can't accept having Ensign Ryazan detained in the brig.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.240
It was the enemy pilot who recklessly tried to initiate contact.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.740
The ensign wasn't at fault.

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:29.040
Based on our records,

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:32.750
the enemy pilot called the ensign by her name.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.300
How do you explain this fact?

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.700
If it's a crime to let the enemy know our names,

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.090
then I'm a criminal as well.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:45.610
The worst crime she committed was arousing my suspicion.

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:48.850
Lieutenant Colonel.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:53.240
Ryazan... Hina doesn't have any connection with the enemy.

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:54.190
I know.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.280
But, Hina is now—

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.950
I'll do everything in my power to have her released as soon as possible.

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.200
Understood.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:18.630
Are you sure about letting him leave the ship?

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:22.970
It's fine. He said he was from Narashino, right?

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.860
That's exactly why.

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:27.580
It appears that he has some connection with the Zogilia pilot.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.100
And to protect the classified information we have to...

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.940
You needn't worry.

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.730
He's being monitored.

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.640
You can come out now, Mayuka-chan.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:45.990
I've noticed you already.

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:50.120
Was it that obvious?

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.830
You don't have to worry. I'm not going to run away.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.960
Well, this is also my mission.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:58.920
You're a soldier, after all.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.140
Well, where do you want to go?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.670
Since I don't have to hide anymore, I can show you around.

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:12.640
You don't have to. I've lived in this town my whole life.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:17.110
Although that was 70 years ago.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:19.780
You're still going on about that?

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.190
But it's the truth.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:25.460
Then you will really need my help.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.740
The town is quite different from how it was 70 years ago.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.120
Is that so?

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.350
Yes!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.500
Will Mayuka be okay?

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.570
To think that she volunteered.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:39.890
Mayuka's taste in men is a bit unexpected.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.520
Like you're one to talk.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:42.980
Eh? But…

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.930
I'll be leaving the bridge. Take care of the rest.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:48.760
Yes, Vice Commander.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:58.150
This is my house?

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.120
Yes.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:02.480
From the address you gave me,
this is the right place.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:08.330
In order to expand Narashino Base,
the military acquired this area.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:13.750
Due to the war situation, that never happened.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.100
What happened to my family?

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.540
Tsubasa...!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.460
Tsubasa-san?

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:21.890
My sister.

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:25.790
Even if it is 74 years later, she would still be...

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:29.220
88 years old.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:34.910
Unfortunately, there is no residential data for "Watase Tsubasa."

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:37.900
The database has had many problems due to the wars.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.510
I'm sorry I'm not able to help you.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.690
Let's go.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.360
Okay.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.100
It looks like a totally different city.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.770
It's been 70 years, after all.

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.110
Thank you very much.

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:23.820
This place seems to have changed, too.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.110
Wait for me!

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:45.800
Here.

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.050
Grab my hand.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.510
O-Okay.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.700
Be careful.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:53.850
Are you okay?

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.510
Y-Yes.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:59.400
Thank you very much.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.620
The school was heavily damaged

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:13.200
during the second Far East War that took place eight years ago.

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:16.760
After that, the school was permanently closed down.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:17.910
I see.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.610
The war, huh?

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:28.260
That's...

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:29.300
Aoba-san?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.560
I see.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.270
This place is still intact.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:49.400
Did you know that it's called a basketball?

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.220
Of course.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.770
I was on the basketball team.

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:57.200
Hmm, basketball has been around since the olden days, eh?

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:58.790
"The olden days", huh?

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:03.480
It's okay. It's the truth.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:08.560
Yes!

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:10.160
Damn it, I lost.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.840
You really don't go easy.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:19.300
Yumihara?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.030
Call me Hina.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:22.940
Hina?

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:26.400
Aoba, believe in me.

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:30.730
Don't get any closer! You are Zogilia's enemy.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.280
It's like they're two different people.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.410
However, I'm certain that was Hina.

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:44.320
Both my school and even my house are gone.

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.870
What should I do now?

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:47.880
Aoba-san...

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.610
I can't see the light vortex.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:51.880
Light vortex?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:52.740
Yup.

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:55.960
When you enter it, it lights up brightly.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:58.680
And when I came to, I was already in this world.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.890
There really isn't one here.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:04.910
Why was it there in the first place?

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.530
There doesn't seem to be any cars driving by.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:16.670
There should be more residents living around here.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.240
You're about to go to the future now.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:22.120
Dio is waiting.

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:25.610
Mayuka-chan.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:26.290
Yes?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.320
Is Zogilia far away from here?

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.640
W-Well, it is pretty far.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:33.770
It's all the way on the other side of the sea.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.010
Why do you ask?

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:38.220
As I thought. I guess the only way to find out is to ask Hina.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.810
Hina?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.040
Are you going to Zogilia?

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.270
Does that sound unreasonable? Or perhaps dangerous?

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:49.120
Of course! Zogilia is our enemy.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:53.900
Moreover, it's possible that they've already seen your face from the previous battle.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:57.990
And if they have seen it already,
you may get captured or even killed.

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:01.020
I see. You're right.

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:02.720
We're in the middle of a war.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:05.160
Isn't it obvious?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.370
What the heck am I saying?

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:09.730
Aoba-san...

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.330
Thank you very much.

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:38.780
What's the matter?

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:43.740
Would it be alright if I no longer pilot a Valiancer?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.480
Right now, Cygnus is the only place I can return to.

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:55.740
But going back there means I might
have to pilot a Valiancer again, right?

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:58.200
But if I were to do that,

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:03.240
someone will get hurt again because of me.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.550
Just like Lee-san.

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.470
I can't... I can't take that...

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:14.150
Aoba-san.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:19.740
When you first appeared, I was really grateful.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:23.320
You were able to match with Dio so suddenly.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.570
Even though it was your first time,

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:27.580
you had an unbelievable Emphater level in Coupling

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:29.960
and even managed to save us twice.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:36.980
Aoba-san is...

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:40.380
I've been thinking that you may be our savior.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:41.970
Mayuka-chan...

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:47.310
It may be wrong to ask this of you
since you're not a soldier, but...

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:50.210
Could you stay with us all?

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.190
Please pilot the Valiancer again.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.060
We all need you.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:57.820
I need you to fight.

00:11:58.130 --> 00:11:59.990
Thanks to you, we didn't have to swim.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.450
You are our savior.

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.460
I understand.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:14.170
Let's go back to the Cygnus.

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:16.590
Yes!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.510
You still want to fight with Luxon?

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:22.750
Yes.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.430
I can't go back to the past

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.520
and my home and family are gone.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:30.060
There are people who need me here.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.640
I want to help them.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.240
I see.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.100
And...

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:38.980
piloting Luxon during a battle may also give me the chance to meet Hina once again.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:42.070
I still have many things I would like to ask her.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:46.490
What will you do if she fights back as an enemy?

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.490
I don't know.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.830
However, I believe in Hina.

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.960
Well, it's fine with me.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.100
Captain!

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:56.710
Hm?

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:57.820
That guy...

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:58.560
No.

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:00.550
It's nothing.

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.320
A boy from the past.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.070
It sounds pretty good, right?

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:05.930
Elvira-kun.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:10.350
As the officer in charge of the
Coupling System, what do you think?

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:16.680
His Emphater level with Dio is by far the greatest.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:21.530
I can't think of any other pilot more suitable for Luxon.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.780
Well then, as for your position...

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:35.140
Wow, that suits you well.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:37.690
Though I'm not sure about you as an ensign.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:42.240
Well, it's more along the lines of a reserve
ensign during a battle or something like that.

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:44.760
More importantly, how are your wounds?

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.010
Ah, I don't have any broken bones and my brain is fine.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.490
I'll get better if I rest for a while longer.

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:51.970
I'm pretty tough, aren't I?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.200
Thank god.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.310
But you know,

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.210
you shouldn't forget this.

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:59.920
It's a miracle that we were both able to come back alive.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:02.570
That's why you shouldn't do that again.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.320
I don't want go through something like this again.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.400
Yes, sir.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.050
I'm truly sorry.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:12.120
And another thing: do not forcibly cut off the Coupling.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.690
In order to enhance the abilities of the linked buddy,

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:21.570
the Coupling system resonates with their thoughts and amplifies their power.

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:25.760
Forcibly cutting it off may cause permanent brain damage.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.920
That was very dangerous.

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:31.520
Come on, say something.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:35.060
Elvira-san, are you worried about me?

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.060
Isn't it obvious?

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:39.130
This is exactly why I don't like pilots.

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:43.780
The new Second Lieutenant doesn't understand a woman's feelings yet.

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:45.310
The same goes for you.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.150
For crying out loud!
It hurts so bad, I feel like I'm going to die.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.360
I don't care anymore.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:55.240
Thank goodness. The secret wasn't leaked.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:58.170
You should thank Watase Aoba.

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:01.000
He's the one who decided to come back here.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.360
You're right.

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:04.710
Because of that I didn't have to make use of your skills.

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:12.220
If he hadn't come back, would you really have shot him?

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.730
You were the one who ordered me to.

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:17.130
Well, that's true.

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:18.980
How's the ship coming?

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:23.740
The left engine nacelle requires a complete overhaul.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:24.840
Oh, my.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.320
It's possible to have it repaired at the Chitose Base.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.540
Chitose, huh?

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.510
It may be a detour, but we have no other choice.

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:34.910
We'll depart once the emergency repairs are completed.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.440
Understood.

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:55.100
What's the matter?

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.970
We've received an SOS from a private ship.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.040
An accident?

00:15:59.040 --> 00:15:59.780
No.

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:02.140
It seems that the Zogilian army have surrounded them.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:06.980
The enemy forces include one
ground unit and eight Air Force units.

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:09.690
Dio, Aoba-san, can you hear me?

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.580
Yes, I hear you.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:15.870
Before you enter the battlefield,
we'll initiate the Coupling.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.480
We'll instruct you when to initiate it.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:19.200
Why is that?

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:24.170
Due to the current situation,
the limit of your Coupling is 300 seconds.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.560
Do you understand?

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:26.510
I understand.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:27.990
Dio?

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:30.170
Understood.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:39.680
We never expected to run into such big prey.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.680
Flying objects are approaching from 80 degrees.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:45.440
It's the Alliance, enemy Valiancers.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.860
From the south?

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.370
Verify the mecha type.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:51.190
One is a Beryl and the other two can't be identified.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.530
The new-type?

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:55.030
Valiancer units, plot an intercept course.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.560
You are approaching the battlefield.

00:16:57.560 --> 00:16:58.560
All right?

00:16:58.560 --> 00:16:59.330
Yeah.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.580
Countdown to Coupling.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.700
Three.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:02.680
Two.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:03.580
One.

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:05.120
Proposing!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.580
Connect with Dio!

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:07.790
Accept.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.590
Activating Approach Ring.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:16.050
Starting Esteftguide Navigation.

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:18.300
Approach Ring assigned.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.550
Beginning linkage.

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.070
Forceveil, opened.

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:23.640
Emphater level is increasing.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.350
No, it's not stabilizing!

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:27.100
Wh-What's happening?

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.100
Shit.

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:29.610
What's the matter?

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:33.280
In order for a Coupling to be successful,
both pilots must be able merge their consciousness.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:37.860
For that to happen, they must completely trust and accept each other.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.830
However, that's not the only cause.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.450
The worst case scenario is that their emotions are getting in the way.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.720
Did something happen?

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:46.340
Haven't I explained this to you before?

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:48.290
They still aren't getting along?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.170
That seems to be the case.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:53.510
Valiancer units are entering the battlefield.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:54.590
We have no choice.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.980
I'm engaging in this condition.

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:57.300
Okay. Me too.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.190
Are you guys serious?

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.370
The enemy's ship is approaching the private ship!

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:25.160
Are they planning to board the ship?

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.540
How barbaric.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.440
Can you target the cables?

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.330
It's impossible.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:32.130
We'd damage the private ship since they're so close.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:41.590
That emblem!

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:43.080
Now I see.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.890
That's why the enemy was trying to capture it.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.100
What are you trying to do, Dio?

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.400
It's reckless to charge in alone!

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:53.520
Damn it.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.820
Dio?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:57.110
Aoba-kun, can you hear me?

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:57.740
Yes.

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:01.780
That ship belongs to Dio's family.

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.230
Dio's?

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:03.870
Then...

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:07.600
Yeah, there's a chance Dio's family may be on the ship.

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.900
Correction, Dio's family <i>is</i> on board.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:13.000
The Weinberg family is the most
famous family among the Alliance.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.940
If they're taken as hostages,
they could be used as a political tool.

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:17.960
That's the enemy's objective.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.470
So that's how it is.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:24.220
But even Dio can't defeat that one alone.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.310
Understood.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:32.810
Dio, can you hear me?

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.190
I may never see my family again.

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:40.010
So I understand how you feel.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:44.950
Your family, the ones you want to protect,
are inside that ship.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.080
Please let me protect them as well.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.950
Dio, let's try Coupling again.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:52.420
Understood.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.500
Connect with Dio!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:58.000
Accept.

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:01.600
Emphater level has increased.

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:04.010
It has reached operational levels.

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:09.770
Coupling completed.

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:11.770
It's good to be young.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.150
Amazing.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:25.620
Impossible! What kind of move was that just now?

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.370
The private ship is pulling away.

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:29.620
R-Retreat!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.080
I won't let you get away!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:36.830
I'm coming, too.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.630
The private ship is now at a safe
distance beyond the blast radius.

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:45.680
Fire!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:00.780
Dio, Aoba-kun, can you hear me?

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:01.990
Yes.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:07.040
Both of you will escort the private ship to Chitose.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:08.980
Understood.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:10.010
Roger.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.880
So that's Chitose Base.

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:24.890
That is...

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:36.600
Hey, Dio?

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.050
Stand down.

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:44.590
Have you forgotten Dio Weinberg's face?

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:50.740
Dio!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:52.010
Fiona!

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:53.120
Are you okay?

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:56.370
I knew that Valiancer was you.

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:57.420
Yeah.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:58.800
His sister?

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:00.630
What are you doing, Dio?

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:03.840
Father...

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:09.590
You are not supposed to waste your time here.

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:14.280
Father?

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:19.100
With my heart, I call out

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:23.470
To the far side, mutually drawn

00:22:23.470 --> 00:22:27.980
Forgetting even the reason I ache

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:32.610
Just for now, please

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:36.780
I know you

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:41.280
I'm searching for you

00:22:41.410 --> 00:22:43.750
Softly pressing my lips

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:50.380
to the bright afterimage I can't keep from leaving

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:58.930
If hesitation is what gives way to the slightest of hopes

00:22:58.930 --> 00:23:03.510
To the many gentle mornings...

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:08.060
and the times I have wondered

00:23:08.060 --> 00:23:12.320
In the future that leads back to that sky,

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:14.570
I want to save you,

00:23:14.570 --> 00:23:16.650
I want to protect you

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:21.030
In the future that arrives at that dream

00:23:21.030 --> 00:23:23.910
Wait for me

00:23:23.910 --> 00:23:28.660
The love we'll surely find

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:33.460
I want you to reach out for it

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:40.060
Next episode, on Buddy Complex: "Scars".
